BashKitten telephony module, 2026-10-11.

TelecomHelper, KittenConnectionService and KittenConnection adapt the account
and connection lifecycle of Phony v2.6, DDOneApps and contributors, exact release
5c52157dec285c73bc84dd1f388247d3741a127f. GPL-3.0 as provided in
agent/vendor/phony/source/LICENSE. The unchanged release is retained there.

Changes: Java library inside BashKitten's main APK; SIP account; validated
backend contacts; supported outgoing handling; independent saved policy;
asynchronous authenticated gateway; actual call menu DTMF; native transient
call audio and configured phone LocalAI. Removed donor application/navigation,
alarms/scheduling/snooze, external triggers, widgets, accessibility triggers,
updates, fake/recorded audio, call recording and donor IVR/TTS configuration.
No donor service or UI is packaged. Own integration files retain AGPL-3.0-only.
